<title>SPAIN: Union Fenosa says output up 19 pct to date.</title>
<headline>Union Fenosa says output up 19 pct to date.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Union Fenosa electricity output rose 19 percent year-on-year to date in 1997, versus a three percent rise for the sector as a whole, the company said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
</text>
